mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is shown above. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.The given curve is \n<div id=\"selectList-334269-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled incorrectSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-334269-0\" style=\"width: 93px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">unbounded</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 542px; top: 13463px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">unbounded</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">bounded</div></div></div>,\nrepresenting\n<div id=\"selectList-334269-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-334269-1\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">an ellipse</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 753px; top: 13463px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">a spiral</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">an ellipse</div></div></div>\nthat is traversed \n<div id=\"selectList-334269-2\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-334269-2\" style=\"width: 132px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">counterclockwise</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 374px; top: 13499px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">counterclockwise</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">clockwise</div></div></div>.\nThus, we must have \n<div id=\"selectList-334269-3\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-3342