ontainer></div></div></div>,\nthe equilibrium point (origin) is <div id=\"selectList-334314-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-334314-1\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">a center</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 553px; top: 19650px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">a center</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">a stable spiral (sink)</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">an unstable spiral (source)</div></div></div>.</div><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>Let <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"608\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42F TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D429 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><mtext>i</mtext><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> where <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"609\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D429 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"2\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D42A TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">p</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">q</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> be an eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"610\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D706 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44F TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mtext>i</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, a complex solution of the system is given by\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"611\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-msub><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c63\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6F\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c70\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6C\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c78\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx